If you're using Win2000, like me, right click on the window bar and choose
properties. Then, while the "screen background" radiobutton is chosen,
click on the blue colored square, and increase the blue value to 255 or
something about that high. Then, click on the leftmost (black) square, and
set that value to three zeroes. Finally, click OK, and choose to change
the icon that you used to startup the game, not just the current instance.

